      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 63,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "But those who seek my soul to destroy it shall go into the lower parts of the earth.",
      "ko": "나의 영혼을 찾아 멸하려 하는 저희는 땅 깊은 곳에 들어가며",
      "source_text_hash": "3d0e40c351ef23368e0a67f93c53cf3106c9f694e97eec1d98681363691efde2",
      "translation_text_hash": "182dc91ee3f652dc201a79ac7d74cd230d65bb0be1c3cdbfa946a6ea63e8b8f8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나의 영혼을 찾아 멸하려 하는 저희는 땅 깊은 곳에 들어가며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "182dc91ee3f652dc201a79ac7d74cd230d65bb0be1c3cdbfa946a6ea63e8b8f8"
      ]
