      "en": "They shall be given over to the power of the sword. They shall be jackal food.",
      "ko": "칼의 세력에 붙인바 되어 시랑의 밥이 되리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c760bebcc09fbe8835de74a94918fcccd9e5aa4c57b3e252d83b29a27b6d630d",
      "translation_text_hash": "3512e782a84abf738c29cf6b47fe08a857e8818e27eb122297c48629b6593d62",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
